# CLAUDE.md — {{FIRM_NAME}} (firm home)

This is the firm's **control center** for all configuration, kit content, and ongoing knowledge. It lives at `{{FIRM_HOME_PATH}}` on the firm's computer. Always available — no external drive required to read this file or work with the firm setup.

**This firm runs the [claude-legal-kit](https://github.com/ChazzCoin/claude-legal-kit).** The kit supplies the structure, rules, skills, and document templates referenced below. Firm-specific facts live in this file and in `firm/FIRM.md`. To pull later kit improvements, ask Claude to **load the latest kit updates** — Claude runs the kit's reconciliation. The kit being tracked, and the last version loaded, are recorded in `.claude/foundation.json`.

Active matter data may live on different drives. The drive registry at `drives/` lists what each drive holds.

**Firm identity:** see `firm/FIRM.md` for legal name, office, members, fee structures, letterhead, and signature blocks. Always read `FIRM.md` before generating any letter, pleading, or correspondence.

