## Layout

The firm home at `{{FIRM_HOME_PATH}}`:

- `firm/` — the firm's working configuration and data
  - `FIRM.md` — firm profile (always read for letterhead, signatures, members)
  - `practice-kit/` — the kit: conduct rules, skills, practice rules, drives, document templates, integrations, vocabulary, research library
  - `practice-registry/` — parties, opposing counsel, courts, judges, experts
  - `matters/` — active client matters
  - `closed-matters/` — resolved matters
- `members/` — per-person workspaces (`_template/` to copy for a new member; `shared-inbox/` for team handoffs)
- `drives/` — drive registry (one file per storage location)
- `private/` — credentials and sensitive identifiers (off-limits to Claude)

